    "Debug build only — cycles Battery.simulationState through off → on battery → on battery low. Lets you test pause-on-battery on Macs without a battery. Stripped from Release builds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅调试版可用。依次模拟接通电源、使用电池和低电量，以便在无电池的 Mac 上测试电池暂停功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Debug build only — keeps the version pinned at the bottom-right in both wallpaper and screensaver modes (never auto-hides). Stripped from Release builds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
