    },
    "If you see the default system wallpaper, or a black screen, use this feature. Restarting the wallpaper agent reloads Aerial's wallpaper extension; your desktop will flicker briefly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果桌面显示系统默认墙纸或黑屏，可用此功能重新载入 Aerial 墙纸扩展。桌面会短暂闪烁。"
          }
