            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导入播放列表…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In %@ mode all screens share one playlist, so auto-pause acts on every screen together — any covered screen pauses the whole group.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 %@ 模式下，所有显示器使用同一播放器。任一显示器被遮挡时，所有显示器都会暂停。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the menu bar, Aerial is a compact popover next to the clock. In the Dock, Aerial is a regular app: the Video Library becomes its main window and the Playback menu gains keyboard shortcuts. Switching takes effect immediately.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "菜单栏模式会在时钟旁显示 Aerial 面板。程序坞模式以视频资料库为主窗口，并在「播放」菜单提供快捷键。切换立即生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In wallpaper mode, moves overlays inward so they aren't covered by the Dock or menu bar. The screensaver is never offset.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在墙纸模式下向内移动叠加内容，避开程序坞和菜单栏。屏幕保护程序不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Include pre-releases which will contain new features, latest bugfixes, and the occasional new bugs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "包含预发布版本，可提前体验新功能和最新修复，也可能遇到新问题。"
