        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已暂停（温度过高）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pauses the desktop wallpaper when system CPU usage stays above the threshold for the set duration. Resumes after two consecutive samples below the threshold, if no other pause applies.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整机 CPU 使用率连续高于阈值达到设定时间时暂停桌面墙纸。连续两次采样低于阈值，且没有其他暂停条件时恢复播放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pauses the wallpaper whenever any app uses a camera — videoconferences, recordings — and resumes when it turns off. Aerial only reads the camera's on/off state, never the picture.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "视频会议或录制等操作使用摄像头时暂停墙纸，摄像头关闭后恢复。Aerial 只读取摄像头的开启状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pauses the wallpaper while macOS Low Power Mode is enabled. Click the popover's play button to override either pause for the current session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 开启低电量模式时暂停墙纸。点击菜单栏面板的播放按钮可临时继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick a starting point. Nothing here is permanent — every option can be changed later in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择初始配置。之后可以在「设置」中调整所有选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick how much information rides on top of the video. The Modern preset is a starting point — you can fine-tune everything later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择要在视频上显示的信息。「现代」预设可作为起点，之后还可以调整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
