    "Strict (0°) and Official (0.83°) switch at true sunrise/sunset. Civil (6°), Nautical (12°) and Astronomical (18°) switch at dawn/dusk, based on how far the Sun sits below the horizon.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "严格（0°）和官方（0.83°）按实际日出和日落切换。民用（6°）、航海（12°）和天文（18°）按太阳低于地平线的角度在晨昏时切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
