          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's New...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新内容…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When Aerial is in the Dock, its icon shows the number of videos left to download. In the menu bar, a small dot on the Aerial icon plays the same role.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在程序坞中，Aerial 图标会显示待下载视频数量。菜单栏模式会在图标上显示小圆点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, each screen can have a different set of overlays.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，每个屏幕可以使用不同的叠加内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, wallpaper/fullscreen mode gets a separate overlay layout from the screensaver.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，墙纸和全屏模式使用独立于屏幕保护程序的叠加布局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the screensaver starts, play the next video in the playlist instead of resuming the last one where it stopped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕保护程序启动时直接播放列表中的下一个视频。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When to pause": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "何时暂停"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where should Aerial live?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在哪显示 Aerial？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "White": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "白色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wi-Fi name needs Location permission": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取 Wi-Fi 名称需要定位权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Window placement": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "是"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes — use Location Services": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "是，使用定位服务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can also hide the video so it doesn't get redownloaded in the future.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "也可以隐藏该视频，避免日后重新下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can also hide the videos so they don't get redownloaded in the future.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "也可以隐藏这些视频，避免日后重新下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can always choose what plays yourself by using the selection tools in the main popover.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可随时在主面板中选择要播放的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have %lld packs that can be moved to the new location.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可将 %lld 个扩展包移至新位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have 1 pack that can be moved to the new location.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可将 1 个扩展包移至新位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've just installed %lld packs:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刚刚安装了 %lld 个扩展包："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've just installed:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刚刚安装："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your cache takes %@ of disk space": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缓存占用 %@ 磁盘空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your existing data will remain in the old location but won't be used. You can delete it manually later if desired.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "现有数据会保留在原位置。之后如有需要，可手动删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your expansions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我的扩展包"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your screensaver settings were reset to defaults.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕保护程序设置已恢复默认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your wallpaper and screensaver keep running — they live in a macOS extension, not in this app.\n\nQuitting Aerial stops what the app itself takes care of in the background: video downloads, automatic pause when windows cover the wallpaper, live overlay data (weather, now playing) and keyboard shortcuts.\n\nYou can close the window instead and keep Aerial running in the Dock.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出后，墙纸和屏幕保护程序会由 macOS 扩展继续运行。\n\nAerial 的后台功能会停止，包括视频下载、遮挡时自动暂停、实时叠加数据（天气、正在播放）和键盘快捷键。\n\n也可以只关闭窗口，让 Aerial 继续在程序坞中运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "at %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "于 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "beta": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cloned": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同步播放"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cm": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "厘米"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ffmpeg is required": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要 ffmpeg"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "https://… or rtsp://… or a YouTube link": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS、RTSP 或 YouTube 链接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "in %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@后"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "independent": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "独立播放"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "independent mirror": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "独立播放镜像"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 26 never prunes its wallpaper-image cache. If you've used Aerial's wallpaper continuity it can grow to many GB over time; Aerial keeps it under 2 GB.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 26 不会自动清理墙纸图片缓存。长期使用 Aerial 墙纸时，缓存可能累积到数 GB。Aerial 会将其控制在 2 GB 以下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS Reduce Motion is enabled. Aerial honors this setting: video fades are disabled, and other transitions (speed changes, occlusion handoffs) are reduced.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 已启用「减弱动态效果」。Aerial 会关闭视频淡入淡出，并减少速度变化和遮挡切换时的过渡效果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS Wallpaper Videos": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 墙纸视频"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS downloads its own aerial videos for the system wallpaper and never deletes them. If you use Aerial instead, they're wasted space — but if you do use a macOS aerial wallpaper, macOS will re-download what it needs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 会下载系统墙纸用的航拍视频。使用 Aerial 时可清理这些缓存以释放空间，切回系统航拍墙纸时 macOS 会按需重新下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS has downloaded %lld video%@, using %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 已下载 %1$lld 个视频%2$@，占用 %3$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
